Error [jet.RunParameterNotCli]: `run`'s parameter isn't a CLI-derived type
  --> tests/ui/retired_cli_marker.jet:5:14
    |
  5 | fn run(args: Args) {
    |              ^^^^
 Why: A typed `fn run(args: T)` entry only works when `T` is a `#CLI`-derived program struct.
 Fix: Mark the program struct `#CLI`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1308

Error [jet.UnknownAppliedRule]: `#Cli` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/retired_cli_marker.jet:1:2
    |
  1 | #Cli struct Args {
    |  ^^^
 Why: `Cli` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Did you mean `#CLI`?
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0927

